cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository is an independent reproduction. If you use it, please cite
  the original paper (listed under references) rather than this software.
title: "TuRBO — Independent Reproduction"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch, citation-anchored reimplementation of TuRBO (Trust Region
  Bayesian Optimization) built by reading the paper rather than porting the
  authors' code. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original authors.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: DivyamVerma22
repository-code: "https://github.com/DivyamVerma22/turbo-reproduction"
license: MIT
references:
  - type: conference-paper
    title: "Scalable Global Optimization via Local Bayesian Optimization"
    year: 2019
    collection-title: "Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems 32"
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.01739"
    authors:
